      "text": "Social/Emotional:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " smiles on his own to get your attention; chuckles (⍉yet a full laugh) when you try to make him laugh; looks @ you, moves, or makes sounds to get or keep your attention. "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Language/Communication:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " makes sounds like \"oooo,\" \"aahh\" (cooing); makes sounds back when you talk to him; turns head toward the sound of your voice. "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Cog:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " if hungry, opens mouth when he sees breast or bottle; looks @ her hands w interest. "
